      "writtenOn": "2016-08-23T21:10:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have described the method below. As we discussed, another possibility would be for the i2cs TPM driver to keep track of a fifo read state. The method I describe below requires only one place in tpm_registers.c where it needs to know if it\u0027s I2C or SPI being used.",
      "parentUuid": "3e3be95b_e9956d90",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 137,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 142,
        "endChar": 34
      },
